<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document"><span id="id1" class="ltx_text" style="position:relative; bottom:-5.0pt;"><img src="2510.06607v1/images/cyber_attack.png" id="g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:24/24;" width="24" height="24" alt="[Uncaptioned image]"></span> Code Agent can be an End-to-end System Hacker: Benchmarking Real-world Threats of Computer-use Agent</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
